<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Call Lightning</h1>
<p>Sphere: Electricity Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast call lightning &lt;target&gt;
use a wand, staff or scroll of call lightning
</pre>
<p>The caster raises both arms to the heavens, shouts 'Sholua electra!' and 
calls a bolt of lightning down on the target. It needs bad weather: under 
the open sky, while it is at least raining. It is far stronger in a 
thunderstorm, when lightning is already in the sky; in plain rain it is 
much weaker. Indoors, or anywhere the weather doesn't reach, it can't be 
cast at all.
</p><p>It does best against clothes and leather and less well against chain and 
plate, and a shield is no use against it. Casting it is an attack and 
starts a fight. You must be standing. No guild teaches it, but it turns up 
on wands, staffs and scrolls among random treasure.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
